.SS "def _open_export ( self, str fmt)\fC [private]\fP"

.PP
Open a raw-frame export for \fCfmt\fP and store its record\&. Opens the file/writer for \fCfmt\fP (\fCcsv\fP, \fCjson\fP, or \fCpcap\fP), writes any required header, and registers a per-format record in \fB_exports\fP\&. Formats are independent, so this never disturbs other active exports\&. Callers must hold \fB_export_lock\fP\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIfmt\fP Export format: 'csv', 'json', or 'pcap'\&. 
.RE
.PP

